@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-a-user-jwt
@roomId = 1
@bookingId = 1

### Register an account (replace ./profile.jpg with a JPEG, PNG, or WebP file)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AccountBoundary

--AccountBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fullName"

Example User
--AccountBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mobileNumber"

+1 555 010 1234
--AccountBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

123 Main Street, Example City
--AccountBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

example-user@example.com
--AccountBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="aadhaarNumber"

123456789012
--AccountBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="password"

replace-with-a-12-character-or-longer-password
--AccountBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profilePhoto"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./profile.jpg
--AccountBoundary--

### Check room availability without signing in
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/availability?checkInDate=2026-11-01&checkOutDate=2026-11-05

### Create a booking (user JWT required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkInDate": "2026-11-01",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-11-05"
}

### List my bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel my booking
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read my profile photo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/profile-photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}